{"path":"string/byte/strrchr","title":"std::strrchr","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::</span>strrchr","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/byte/strrchr","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Finds the last occurrence of ch (after conversion to char) in the byte string pointed to by str. The terminating null character is considered to be a part of the string and can be found if searching for '\\0'.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/cstring\">&lt;cstring&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> strrchr<span class=\"br0\">(</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> str, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> ch <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\">\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\"> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> strrchr<span class=\"br0\">(</span> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> str, <span class=\"kw4\">int</span> ch <span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Finds the last occurrence of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">ch</span></code> (after conversion to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">char</span></span></code>) in the byte string pointed to by <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str</span></code>. The terminating null character is considered to be a part of the string and can be found if searching for <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es5\">\\0</span>'</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<table class=\"t-par-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> str\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> pointer to the null-terminated byte string to be analyzed\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-par\">\n<td> ch\n</td>\n<td> -\n</td>\n<td> character to search for\n</td></tr></table>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Pointer to the found character in <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">str</span></code>, or null pointer if no such character is found.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;cstring&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">char</span> input<span class=\"br0\">[</span><span class=\"br0\">]</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"/home/user/hello.c\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">char</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span> output <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> std<span class=\"sy4\">::</span><span class=\"me2\">strrchr</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>input, <span class=\"st0\">'/'</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span>output<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n        <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1774\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> output <span class=\"sy2\">+</span> <span class=\"nu0\">1</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>hello.c</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/byte/strchr\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>strchr</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  finds the first occurrence of a character <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/wide/wcsrchr\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>wcsrchr</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  finds the last occurrence of a wide character in a wide string <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string/rfind\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>rfind</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  find the last occurrence of a substring <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_string&lt;CharT,Traits,Allocator&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/c/string/byte/strrchr\">C documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>strrchr</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/byte","title":"Null-terminated byte strings"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::strrchr","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations. Finds the last occurrence of ch (after conversion to char) in the byte string pointed to by str."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"str, ch"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Pointer to the found character in str, or null pointer if no such character is found."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"strchr","note":"finds the first occurrence of a character"},{"label":"wcsrchr","note":"finds the last occurrence of a wide character in a wide string"},{"label":"rfind","note":"find the last occurrence of a substring"}]}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":166,"codeBlockCount":2}
